**Fix:** guard that one line so it handles a missing 12-month change, for example print `n/a` when `ch1y` is `None`. I'm only allowed to run the checker, not edit scripts, so I haven't made the change.

**What the draft says:**
- **Decision:** AVOID (CORE), conviction 3 as a placeholder until the scorecard runs.
- **Why not a buy:** ROE has fallen steadily from 15.1% to 11.5%, and management expects net interest margins to keep shrinking, so I judged the decline structural. P/E and P/B are at their 5-year medians, so the stock isn't cheap. The mechanical fair value is flagged unreliable.
- **Entry price:** 33.0 CNY, about where P/B would be back near its 5-year low of 0.6x. The default (base fair value less 20%) works out above today's price, so it couldn't be used.

Once the scorecard runs, the conviction and entry price in the draft may need to change to match its score.
